            <div xml:id="d425-a2">

                <pb facs="0498" n="438" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg438"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Proposition for most gracious consideration.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Instead of a withdrawal of the concession, as punishment for noncompliance with
                    Section IV, 8, let it rather be ordered:</p>
                <p>That any company which does not comply with the provisions of Section IV, 8— <list>
                        <label>(1)</label>
                        <item>May issue no policies in Prussia, except with dividends which are
                            payable annually.</item>
                        <pb facs="0499" n="439" xml:id="pg439"/>
                        <label>(2)</label>
                        <item>Where such a company publishes a statement showing the amount of its
                            surplus, it should always state that only those policies which are in
                            force at the time of striking the balance shall participate in the
                            future dividends from the accrued surplus.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <list>
                    <label>(1)</label>
                    <item>The question of control will be settled per se as each policy receives its
                        dividend annually.</item>
                    <label>(2)</label>
                    <item>No person taking out a new policy could erroneously be made to think that
                        he could draw benefits from the large surplus from former policies.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
